# Entity-catalog cross-check (gspl_entity_catalog.txt) confirmed every named entity this chapter
# touches already exists in the GSPL universe: Jesus, Pontius Pilate, Pilate's wife, Joseph of
# Arimathea, Nicodemus, Mary (mother of Jesus), Mary Magdalene, Mary mother of James and Joseph /
# Mary mother of James and Joses, Clopas, Golgotha, Gabbatha (the Stone Pavement), Garden Tomb,
